{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/854193-infestation-swarms","id":854193,"title":"Infestation Swarms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-27T13:49:26-07:00","id":854193,"title":"Infestation Swarms","content":"Something I pointed out when the PDF was first released, which doesn't seem to have been addressed in the revised one, is that the book doesn't have rules for swarms in it. The Chronicles of Darkness core likewise doesn't have rules for swarms. The Infestation Atavism merely says you become a swarm with a certain radius, but without a rule to reference there isn't actually any mechanical effect for being such a swarm. It may be the intent that your presence inflicts the Swarm Lair trait in that form, but it doesn't reference that page either. The only rules for swarms I've been able to find in any CofD book are in the text for a Swarm tilt in Demon: the Descent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6806-abattoirista","name":"Abattoirista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T12:44:18-07:00","id":856659,"title":"","content":"This ability did seem a little odd. It ultimately looks like there isn't a universal swarm rule. Each citing of a swarm seems to work differently. The vampire swarm form seems to be a resilient swarm that takes very little dmg from most sources and must roll to do damage fairly normally. Meanwhile the way the Beast's swarm form is worded it seems like it gets no benefits of damage reduction but can simply deal dmg to someone without roll. Simply states they can converge on a target and deal lethal damage equal to their dots in lair.<br /> <br /> Clarification if this is the correct way of seeing things would be great.<br /> <br /> Demon Swarm = Tilt, Vamp Swarm = Defensive, Beast Swarm = Offensive. Atleast that's how it currently looks if there wasn't intended to be universal rules for swarms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9236,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","user":"Yig1015w","date":". 03-31-2016, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","name":"Yig1015w","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T11:00:35-07:00","id":867667,"title":"","content":"Maybe I'm alone here, but I really think this needs to be addressed. Infestation requires a rule that isn't in the book. I don't think &quot;you should also have Demon&quot; is a good answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6806-abattoirista","name":"Abattoirista","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}